# Generated monster sprites ARE committed: they are game content, and the
# deploy needs them. At ~40 kB each for 32 monsters that is a trivial cost.

# Never commit credentials. The handoff document notes an SSH key that is
# committed in another repo; do not repeat that here.
*.key
*.pem
id_rsa*
